sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Ext as Extension (popup/background)
  participant API as Backend (server.js)
  participant Embed as EmbedAPI (LLM)
  participant VDB as VectorDB (Chroma)
  participant LLM as LLM Provider

  User->>Ext: enter query
  Ext->>API: POST /search {q, auth}
  API->>Embed: request embedding for {q}
  Embed-->>API: return embedding vector
  API->>VDB: vector search (k-NN)
  VDB-->>API: candidate ids + scores
  API->>LLM: build prompt + request completion
  LLM-->>API: answer (text)
  API-->>Ext: JSON {results, answer}
  Ext-->>User: render results
